			dependencies: ["B2C3D4E5F6A10021"]
			x: -6.0d
			y: 10.5d
			description: [
				"Four string crafts into wool; three wool and three planks make a bed."
				""
				"Sleep through the night and set your spawn somewhere that isn't the open void."
