			y: 12.0d
			description: [
				"Six smooth stone around two panes of glass builds a &eStone Block Generator&r - it churns out stone on its own, no water-and-lava rig to babysit."
				""
				"Tier 0's groundwork is poured. Time to go meet some frogs."
			]
			tasks: [{ id: "C3D4E5F6A1B20042", item: { count: 1, id: "cobblegengalore:block_gen_stone" }, type: "item" }]
